  "label": "User projected onto the woman expressing amazement",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the woman (person) who is depicted with an expression of amazement or wonder. This projection is implied by the text 'this faceapp stuff is incredible!' which is overlaid on her image, suggesting that the user (the viewer) is identifying with her reaction to the FaceApp technology. The woman visually represents the 'user' or 'observer' who is amazed by the capabilities of FaceApp, which is the subject of the text.",
